                        "recommendationid": "233163494",
                        "author": {
                            "steamid": "76561198047961358",
                            "num_reviews": 83,
                            "playtime_forever": 212,
                            "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0,
                            "playtime_at_review": 212,
                            "last_played": 1787100548
                        },
                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "If you liked Life Quest and Magic life back in the day, you'll probably like this. Completed and bought everything in about 3.5 hours. Fun kind of game that was popular over a decade ago. You can pick this up for a single buck when it goes on sale like every other month; never buy an old game for full price... actually I don't even buy new games at full price, lol! Anyways, there are no achievements, if that's important to you. I read through some of the reviews, they're wrong, lol. There were NO bugs. Never crashed once. And no, it's not a hidden object game. It HAS a LITTLE bit of hidden object in it, though. Enjoy the nostalgia!",
